
# Find top documents that match input and send them to GPT along with input, and print its response.

!rename question

!llm-embedding model=text-embedding-ada-002
!rename needle

!table embeddings

!dot-product right=needle
!sort reverse=1
!take n=5

!join sep=\n\n---\n\n

!llm
You are a helpful assistant. This is documentation pertaining to the user query:

{input}

Answer this question. Be terse.
{question}
